cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Insurance Document Prompt-Injection Detection Dataset"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-29"
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >
  A large-scale, reproducible benchmark dataset for prompt-injection
  detection in insurance AI systems. Contains 289,874 samples (144,937 benign /
  144,937 malicious) generated by a five-module pipeline (A-B-C-D-E) covering
  15 adversarial attack families and 58 unique payload templates. The release is
  predominantly text-based, with 1,870 records retaining associated document images,
  providing group-aware train/val/test splits (231,900 / 28,986 / 28,988),
  attack-family and payload-level metadata, and a fully reproducible generation pipeline.
keywords:
  - prompt injection
  - insurance AI
  - adversarial machine learning
  - document classification
  - security benchmarks
  - synthetic dataset generation
